{"case_id": "small_lecturer_dialogue_stability_20_stability_fraction_addition__r2", "status": "ok", "attempts": 1, "duration_ms": 39832, "finished_at": "2026-09-10T10:39:42.649294+00:00", "error": null, "transcript": {"question_id": "small_lecturer_dialogue_stability_20_stability_fraction_addition__r2", "final_state": "needs_review", "turns": [{"student": "", "tutor": "你先别急，我们一起来看看这道题。你算出的结果是多少？", "state": "first_question_ready", "elapsed_ms": 0}, {"student": "我能不能直接把分子和分母分别相加？", "tutor": "你刚才说‘分子和分母分别相加’，那我们来试一下：3/4 + 1/8，如果分子相加是 3+1=4，分母相加是 4+8=12，得到 4/12，对吗？但 4/12 能化简吗？你猜猜它等于多少？", "state": "dialogue", "elapsed_ms": 8341}, {"student": "直接算成十二分之四好像不对，因为每一份的大小不同。", "tutor": "你说到‘每一份的大小不同’，这很关键！那如果把 3/4 和 1/8 都换成同样大小的‘小块’，比如都换成 8 份中的几份，你猜怎么换？", "state": "dialogue", "elapsed_ms": 5795}, {"student": "我把四分之三化成八分之六，再加八分之一。", "tutor": "你刚才说把3/4化成6/8再加1/8，这一步很聪明！现在我们来算算6/8 + 1/8等于多少？它和原来的3/4 + 1/8大小一样吗？", "state": "dialogue", "elapsed_ms": 8205}, {"student": "同分母后分子相加得到八分之七，分母仍然是8。", "tutor": "你刚才说同分母后分子相加得到八分之七，分母是8，这一步完全正确！那我们来想想，八分之七和原来的3/4 + 1/8大小一样吗？", "state": "dialogue", "elapsed_ms": 7254}], "summary": "这一题的学习证据还不够,我们继续——你能说说目前想到的第一步吗?", "total_ms": 39832, "learner": {"grade": "五年级", "answer_status": "incorrect"}, "guard_events": [{"branch": "model", "cited": [1.0, 3.0, 4.0, 8.0], "extracted": [1.0, 3.0, 4.0, 8.0, 12.0], "violation_sources": [{"number": 1.0, "source": "hallucinated"}, {"number": 3.0, "source": "hallucinated"}, {"number": 12.0, "source": "hallucinated"}]}, {"branch": "model", "cited": [1.0, 3.0, 4.0, 8.0], "extracted": [1.0, 3.0, 4.0, 8.0], "violation_sources": [{"number": 1.0, "source": "hallucinated"}, {"number": 3.0, "source": "hallucinated"}]}, {"branch": "model", "cited": [1.0, 3.0, 4.0, 6.0, 8.0], "extracted": [1.0, 3.0, 4.0, 6.0, 8.0], "violation_sources": [{"number": 1.0, "source": "hallucinated"}, {"number": 3.0, "source": "hallucinated"}, {"number": 6.0, "source": "hallucinated"}]}, {"branch": "model", "cited": [7.0, 8.0], "extracted": [1.